OL,3,GNEWSATighter controls on rented housing
OL,4,Ato start in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FStricter planning controls on a city's
OL,7,Fhouses in multiple occupation (HMO)
OL,8,Fwill come in next year, despite calls
OL,9,Ffor them to start immediately.
OL,11,FThe current rules in Cambridge allow
OL,12,Fthe creation of HMOs of up to six
OL,13,Fresidents through permitted
OL,14,Fdevelopment.
OL,16,FAll HMOs will have to seek planning
OL,17,Fpermission for the change of status,
OL,18,Fregardless of size. The city council's
OL,19,Fcabinet approved the move, which will
OL,20,Fcome into effect in 12 months' time.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
