OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATighter controls on rented housing
OL,4,Ato start in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FStephen Kelly, joint director of
OL,7,Fplanning at the Labour-led council,
OL,8,Ftold the cabinet that waiting to
OL,9,Fimplement restrictions would help them
OL,10,Favoid "potential claims for
OL,11,Fcompensation".
